These are supplimentary files for the MiNT library.

All but very old versions of the library will have utmp.c and wtmp.c
included, but in many versions they have been broken. Mintlib versions above
28 are ok.

Writev.c contains an implementation (which is not quite complete as it
doesn't return all the possible error codes) of the BSD system call of the
same name.

Stephen Usher, 9th August, 1993.
